WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.901
-Welcome back to "Late Night."
We're here with Salma Hayek.

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:06.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you mentioned
this sort of long layoff

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.774 line:92%
between this big action film

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you've got another one
coming up too.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:11.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a film that everybod
is very excited about.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:15.682
It's Chloé Zhao, who is
obviously an incredible director

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.183 line:92%
and she's doing "The Eternals.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:17.884 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's a Marvel film.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:20.620
And it must be so exciting
to get asked to do that.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.089 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-I was super excited,

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:26.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
especially because
I was already fond of Chloé.

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:32.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now she's one of the few
Oscar winner female directors.

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:34.834 line:92%
But even then I was a superfan

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:39.039
and it was super exciting
also to do a Marvel film.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:42.542 line:92%
And the only weird thing i

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:45.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
that they don't let you
read the script.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:46.913 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:49.249 line:92%
-You have to sign the contract

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:50.817 line:92%
without reading the script

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:51.951 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It was really strange.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:54.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did it. I did it.
I was nervous.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.955 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But I trusted her.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.123 line:92%
And then there's another thing

00:00:57.123 --> 00:01:02.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're like, "Yes, oh, my God,
I got a Marvel...!"

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:06.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, what are the odds, right
at my age?

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.101 line:92%
But you cannot tell anybody.

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.436 line:92%
And I was one of the first ones.

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:12.505
You cannot tell your mother.
You cannot tell your father.

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:15.542
Because let me tell you,
they cannot hold a secret.

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:18.211 line:92%
You cannot tell your kids.

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:21.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was torturous.
It was torturous.

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.482 line:92%
Finally we got to say it.

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And when you said
you didn't see the script,

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:28.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
so how much did Chloé tell you
about your character

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:33.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
that was enough informatio
for you to say yes?

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:36.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Not enough. No, she said,
"Your character,

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:39.132 size:84% position:42% line:92%
she -- it's an Eternal.

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:42.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not she or he because
it's an Eternal.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:45.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the Eternals
have a mission on Earth.

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.207 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And out of the Eternals,

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:50.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're the only one
that talks to the Celestials

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.680 line:92%
and so you're in charge."

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:57.450 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And that's it.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.252 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Take it or leave it.

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:03.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's -- still today
it's the only thing I'm allowe

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:05.291 line:92%
to say to you about the movie.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.360 line:92%
The rest is still a secret

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:10.196 align:start size:94% position:6%
When you pay the ticket,
you will know what's the rest.

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:13.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
We signed a contract,
then they gave me the script

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sure
it will be worth waiting.

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:19.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, you are --
you have many animals,

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:23.276
but I think you're the first
person I've ever talked to

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:24.644 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
who has a pet owl.

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:27.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
And how did this come abou
because --

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:32.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, Seth, did you have to sho
that specific picture?

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:34.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean,
did you have to take it?

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.955 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.724 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I know, I know.

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:40.226 size:75% position:38%
-Here's another one.
Here's another one.

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:41.594 line:92%
You look very sporty here.

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.163 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-And there are the dogs.

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.330 line:92%
See, there is the dog also

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And there's the owl.
-I love my owl.

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:49.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn't know much
about owls when I got --

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:51.704 size:78% position:39%
one thing that really
impresses me is that

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:54.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
they don't drink any water
-Uh-huh.

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:57.644
-They just get all the water
from the rat that they eat

00:02:57.644 --> 00:03:00.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh. [ Chuckles ]
I didn't know that either.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
All the juices are soaked in

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:05.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's all the liquids
that they need.

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:10.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
And however,
they don't eat other food.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.426
They don't try to eat your food,
like my dogs.

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:17.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How often does an owl
need a rat to eat?

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Depending on the weather
and the weight

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.970 size:88% position:44%
and the size of the rat,
but about twice a day.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
-About twice a day.

00:03:25.905 --> 00:03:29.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you got a lot of rats
around the house?

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:32.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, order them.
You order them.

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:35.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know if I'm allowe
to say the name of the company

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.816 line:92%
where you order everything else?

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:39.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Blue Apron?
Is it Blue Apron?

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:40.386 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:42.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, no.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:45.959
So, you got an owl without
knowing much about the owl

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:49.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you just explained,
you said yes to "The Eternals"

00:03:49.729 --> 00:03:50.597 line:92%
with very little information

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:55.168
It seems like you're a perso
who jumps in with both feet.

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:56.603 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I'm an adventurer.

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:58.471 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm an adventurer.

00:03:58.471 --> 00:04:00.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you know what?
So is my owl.

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:02.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah?
-Because --

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:05.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
She is very unusual --
she's female.

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:07.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
She does
a lot of strange things.

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:11.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
Even if I had known,
she still is very surprising

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:14.320 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
For example...

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.888 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
she likes wine.

00:04:15.888 --> 00:04:17.991 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Doesn't go for the food.

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:20.126 line:92%
Doesn't go for the water.

00:04:20.126 --> 00:04:21.594 size:81% position:41% line:92%
She goes for the wine.

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:23.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you think, "Oh,
because it's red,

00:04:23.529 --> 00:04:26.899 line:92%
probably think it's blood.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:28.101 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Not that cheap wine.

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:31.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you have the cheap wine
she does not bother.

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:35.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you have a good red wine --
I have witnesses of this.

00:04:35.975 --> 00:04:38.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
She goes -- I don't even kno
if she drinks it.

00:04:38.144 --> 00:04:41.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
She just wants to put her head
inside or something.

00:04:41.381 --> 00:04:43.283 line:92%
You have to cover your glass

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:44.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
when you're in my house
at a party.

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:47.420
-I like the idea that if
someone comes to your hous

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:48.888 line:92%
and brings a bottle of wine,

00:04:48.888 --> 00:04:54.360
you pour it, and if the ow
doesn't eat it, you're offended.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.462 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-This is very good idea.

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:58.965
Before I drink it, I'm gonna see
if she goes for it,

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:02.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I'm too old
for a bad wine hangover.

00:05:02.302 --> 00:05:03.036 line:92%
-Yeah. That's a good call.

00:05:03.036 --> 00:05:04.804 size:75% position:38%
Hey, congratulations
on something else.

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:07.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
Before we go,
you're receiving a star

00:05:07.573 --> 00:05:10.143 line:92%
on the Hollywood Walk of Fame.

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:11.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yes.
-So well deserved.

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:13.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is that exciting?
-Thank you so much.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:16.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you.
This is very exciting, yeah.

00:05:16.683 --> 00:05:18.718 size:75% position:38%
-How do you find out
something like that?

00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:19.452 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Who gives you the call?

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:23.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, this time
they kind of surprised me.

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:26.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was on a call
with my publicist

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:30.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then people started
walking into the living room

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:31.998 line:92%
and they were all talking.

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:32.565 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm like, "Guys."

00:05:32.565 --> 00:05:35.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
My husband is there,
my friend is there, you know

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:39.906 line:92%
And all different nationalities,

00:05:39.906 --> 00:05:42.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
everybody talking
in different languages.

00:05:42.075 --> 00:05:42.842 line:92%
And I'm like, "Shh! Guys."

00:05:42.842 --> 00:05:47.547
And then -- and somebody comes
with a computer and puts it --

00:05:47.547 --> 00:05:49.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
and all of a sudden
they turn on the TV

00:05:49.615 --> 00:05:51.084 line:92%
and there's a television show.

00:05:51.084 --> 00:05:52.352 line:92%
And I'm like, "Are you kidding

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:53.920 line:92%
I'm trying to do business here."

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:56.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they --
they're like, "Look, look.

00:05:56.422 --> 00:05:57.423 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And I'm like, "What?"

00:05:57.423 --> 00:05:58.157 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And it's like a show,

00:05:58.157 --> 00:05:59.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they start saying
all these names.

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:02.161 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And I go, "What? What?"

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:03.796 line:92%
And they said, "You got a star."

00:06:03.796 --> 00:06:04.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What do you mean,
'You got a star'?"

00:06:04.964 --> 00:06:07.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Yeah, the walk of Hollywood
star."

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:10.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "No, but there's
a lot of people.

00:06:10.036 --> 00:06:11.037 line:92%
I think I'm just nominated."

00:06:11.037 --> 00:06:13.139 size:75% position:38%
No, you got the star
with all the people.

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:15.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was so shocked.
I was so shocked.

00:06:15.708 --> 00:06:17.877 line:92%
-Well, incredibly well-deserved.

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:18.911 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Overdue for my money.

00:06:18.911 --> 00:06:20.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
And let me just say,
it is always

00:06:20.446 --> 00:06:21.514 line:92%
such a delight to see you.

00:06:21.514 --> 00:06:23.216 line:92%
Thanks so much for being here.

00:06:23.216 --> 00:06:26.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Same here.
Thank you so much.

00:06:26.319 --> 00:06:28.621 line:92%
Finally I made it to your show

